  "description": "Provider-agnostic database provisioning — create a real MySQL/PostgreSQL database (plus a scoped user and connection string) on Plesk, cPanel, or a bare/standalone server behind one interface. The counterpart to WebSvc.SqlConnector: that talks to a database that exists, this makes one exist in the first place. Does not create tables — provisions an empty, ready-to-use database and stops.",
